(*NOTEMPTY_ATSTART)`,`(*NO_DOTSTAR_ANCHOR)`,`(*NO_JIT)` | [ ] |\n| 82 | `pcre2_compile` | randomized *valid* pattern generator: literals, classes, POSIX classes, quantifiers (greedy/lazy/possessive/interval), alternation, groups (capturing, non-capturing, atomic, named, dup-named, conditional, `(?\\|`), back references, recursion `(?R)`/`(?1)`/`(?&name)`, lookaheads/lookbehinds (fixed & variable), `\\b \\B \\A \\Z \\z \\G \\K \\R \\X \\C \\h \\H \\v \\V \\N`, `\\p{...}`/`\\P{...}` across all script/category names in `_pcre2_utt_8`, callouts, verbs — **500+ patterns per option combo** | [ ] |\n| 83 | `pcre2_code_copy` / `pcre2_code_copy_with_tables` | copy then match/query; copies of deserialized codes | [ ] |\n\n### F. `pcre2_pattern_info` — every request × pattern shape\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration | [ ] |\n|---|----------------|---------------|-----|\n| 84 | `pcre2_pattern_info` | all 27 `PCRE2_INFO_*` requests × each randomized compiled pattern | [ ] |\n| 85 | `pcre2_pattern_info` | `PCRE2_INFO_FIRSTBITMAP` — compare the 32-byte bitmap when non-NULL | [ ] |\n| 86 | `pcre2_pattern_info` | `PCRE2_INFO_NAMETABLE` + `NAMECOUNT` + `NAMEENTRYSIZE` — compare whole table bytes | [ ] |\n| 87 | `pcre2_pattern_info` | `PCRE2_INFO_ALLOPTIONS`/`ARGOPTIONS`/`EXTRAOPTIONS` after inline directives | [ ] |\n| 88 | `pcre2_pattern_info` | `MATCHLIMIT`/`DEPTHLIMIT`/`HEAPLIMIT` set by `(*LIMIT_*)` in pattern | [ ] |\n| 89 | `pcre2_callout_enumerate` | patterns with numeric callouts, string callouts, `AUTO_CALLOUT` — compare each callout block field | [ ] |\n\n### G. `pcre2_match_data_*`\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration | [ ] |\n|---|----------------|---------------|-----|\n| 90 | `pcre2_match_data_create` | `ovecsize` 0,1,2,16,1000 × `NULL`/custom gcontext | [ ] |\n| 91 | `pcre2_match_data_create_from_pattern` | each compiled pattern × `NULL`/custom gcontext | [ ] |\n| 92 | `pcre2_get_ovector_count` / `pcre2_get_ovector_pointer` | after success, after `NOMATCH`, aft